entries.description:
Dawn Ink re-skin of astromia.eu: every section, the order, the live Bulgarian copy and the 4-step form, free preview and order flow are kept, but the navy-and-gold template look becomes warm paper, plum ink, rosé and one clay colour for every CTA, set in Playfair + Sofia Sans (free Google Fonts with native Bulgarian letterforms). The navy-gold book is now the only dark object on the page, so the eye goes book, name field, button, and step 1 stays above the fold. On award you get the HTML/CSS source, Figma-ready SVG assets (chart wheel, cover, icons, ornaments), PNG/JPG in every size, the font list and a short style guide. Unlimited revisions: any change (colour, font, layout, text) delivered within a few hours - rate or comment and I will revise.
